    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a <strong>Reaction</strong> when a hostile creature moves within 5 feet of you, you can trigger a blinding micro-flare in its face. The target must succeed on a <strong>Dexterity saving throw</strong> against your Program Save DC or have <strong>Disadvantage on all attack rolls</strong> until the end of its current turn.</p><p>You can use this feature once per <strong>Short or Long Rest</strong>.</p>"
